# More info: https://docs.docker.com/engine/reference/builder/#dockerignore-file
# Ignore build and test binaries.
bin/
# Keep local state and anything cluster-identifying out of the build context.
.cache/
evidence/
.venv/
dist/
# The rendered file-based catalog is the only dist/ content an image needs (catalog.Dockerfile).
!dist/catalog
__pycache__/
*.kubeconfig
kubeconfig*
DISPOSABLE_OPENSHIFT_CLUSTERS.md
.env
